WEBVTT

00:09:59.586 --> 00:10:00.777
to rebuild better

00:10:00.801 --> 00:10:02.323
and to reimagine better.

00:10:02.347 --> 00:10:05.420
And we have always been a country
of entrepreneurship,

00:10:05.444 --> 00:10:07.110
design and imagination,

00:10:07.134 --> 00:10:08.891
and what a perfect place to start

00:10:08.915 --> 00:10:10.966
when the majority
of Americans are with us.

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:12.154
BD: Absolutely.

00:10:12.178 --> 00:10:14.891
Well, thank you so, so much, María Teresa.

00:10:14.915 --> 00:10:15.874
MTK: Thank you.